**Historical details and final status through S3E12 (campaign complete):** Koh previously held three urns; after S3E11 all briefly installed and released back into play (no confirmed post-ejection bag); GM's S3E09 recap referred to second urn as Khalazar's brain, and S3E12 magical vision shows three extracted organs (brain, heart and lungs); these identifications are supported by the vision, not a separate pathological examination. Gate mechanism was tested with full set in S3E11 and Khalazar physically reconstituted in S3E12; post-use empty vessel whereabouts untracked. No original audio, prop sheets or maps checked. [S3E08 comparison](../../../reports/DELVERS_S3E08_ASR_COMPARISON_2026-10-26.md) · [S3E09 comparison](../../../reports/DELVERS_S3E09_ASR_COMPARISON_2026-10-26.md) · [S3E10 comparison](../../../reports/DELVERS_S3E10_ASR_COMPARISON_2026-10-26.md) · [S3E11 comparison](../../../reports/DELVERS_S3E11_ASR_COMPARISON_2026-10-26.md).
